<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF offers 120 bln yen 1.0 pct 2-yr notes.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF offers 120 bln yen 1.0 pct 2-yr notes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance (MOF) said on Thursday it was offering 120 billion yen in 1.0 percent two-year government notes through a price-competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at 0300 GMT and the results will be announced at 0530 GMT.</p>
<p>The issue date will be July 22 and the maturity date will be July 21, 1999.</p>
</text>
